{"4247050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "9.8", "steam_appid": 4247050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4938430], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/e9fb8244fdcfe9bc812ab831983e89eb.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/e9fb8244fdcfe9bc812ab831983e89eb.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/e9fb8244fdcfe9bc812ab831983e89eb.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine</strong> the long lost child of KSP and Lunar Lander. With the same amount of chaos, high intensity-high reward, but in a seemingly casual Sunday afternoon relaxed aesthetics. <strong>Start with almost nothing. Build the capability to see farther, reach farther, and unlock the next layer of space. </strong>Establish observatories, deploy telescopes, and grow your infrastructure to reveal new targets and opportunities and then aim upwards and put your flying skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9.8 is a 2D space-agency simulator where a fully physics-driven universe (N-body orbits, atmospheres, heat management, hydrodynamics) makes every small step earned.</strong> Build your program from first hops to interplanetary operations through a uniquely designed local star-system cluster.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In 9.8 you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and fly rockets</strong> under <i>simulation-grade</i> constraints: mass, fuel, TWR, heat, staging, aerodynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>N-body orbital mechanics</strong>: gravity from multiple bodies shapes transfers, captures, and chaos. Everything is physics means that yes, theoretically it is possible to deorbit the moon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric flight + re-entry</strong>: launch windows and trajectories matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water/hydrodynamics</strong>: splashdowns and surface operations behave like a real medium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your space program</strong>: plan missions, manage resources, and unlock new technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Solara system</strong> by building infrastructure and discovering all of the secrets that the cosmos hides.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLY ROCKETS, NOT SCRIPTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every maneuver is flown. Throttle control, trajectory shaping, staging decisions, and precise piloting determine whether you reach orbit or become debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/b6136599673647827bf597224c3aa5fe.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/b6136599673647827bf597224c3aa5fe.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/b6136599673647827bf597224c3aa5fe.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD AND DESIGN YOUR VEHICLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct vehicles to match the mission. Iterate on design, test under real constraints, and refine until your craft can survive the environment you’re sending it into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/fab7ee9ab31d9363c075500098f21964.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/fab7ee9ab31d9363c075500098f21964.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/fab7ee9ab31d9363c075500098f21964.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vehicle construction tools are actively evolving as development continues.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE ACROSS SPACE, ATMOSPHERE, SURFACE, AND OCEANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments demand different solutions: vacuum operations, atmospheric flight, surface landings, and ocean interaction with hydrodynamics that behaves like a real medium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/5b6fef7d93a815f086fed17b6942a17f.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/5b6fef7d93a815f086fed17b6942a17f.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/5b6fef7d93a815f086fed17b6942a17f.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERYTHING IS PHYSICS (NO RAILS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N-body gravity, atmospheres, heat, buoyancy, and momentum all interact. The universe doesn’t “help” you and if you push the system hard enough, extreme outcomes are possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/736478049acbc4547efc0f0cd7c2f3e2.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/736478049acbc4547efc0f0cd7c2f3e2.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/736478049acbc4547efc0f0cd7c2f3e2.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD INFRASTRUCTURE THAT EXPANDS YOUR REACH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish stations, colonies, and surface installations to support longer missions, extend operations, and turn distant targets into achievable objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/8bac045fd65668526798e033eabcd9fb.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/8bac045fd65668526798e033eabcd9fb.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/8bac045fd65668526798e033eabcd9fb.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER UNIQUE RESOURCES AND LOGISTICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources and logistics constraints turn exploration into a real program. Build supply chains, comms satellites, manage tradeoffs, and solve the engineering problems that come with expanding outward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/23b582b84a08468f6d71ae1958549582.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/23b582b84a08468f6d71ae1958549582.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/23b582b84a08468f6d71ae1958549582.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/e9fb8244fdcfe9bc812ab831983e89eb.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/e9fb8244fdcfe9bc812ab831983e89eb.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/e9fb8244fdcfe9bc812ab831983e89eb.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine</strong> the long lost child of KSP and Lunar Lander. With the same amount of chaos, high intensity-high reward, but in a seemingly casual Sunday afternoon relaxed aesthetics. <strong>Start with almost nothing. Build the capability to see farther, reach farther, and unlock the next layer of space. </strong>Establish observatories, deploy telescopes, and grow your infrastructure to reveal new targets and opportunities and then aim upwards and put your flying skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_par