_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/b6136599673647827bf597224c3aa5fe.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/b6136599673647827bf597224c3aa5fe.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD AND DESIGN YOUR VEHICLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct vehicles to match the mission. Iterate on design, test under real constraints, and refine until your craft can survive the environment you’re sending it into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/fab7ee9ab31d9363c075500098f21964.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/fab7ee9ab31d9363c075500098f21964.webm?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/fab7ee9ab31d9363c075500098f21964.mp4?t=1787242636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vehicle construction tools are actively evolving as development continues.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE ACROSS SPACE, ATMOSPHERE, SURFACE, AND OCEANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments demand different solutions: vacuum operations, atmospheric flight, surface landings, and ocean interaction with hydrodynamics that behaves like a real medium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247050/extras/5b6fef7d93a815f086fed17b6942a17f.poster.avif?t=1787242636\" width=1170 height=658 ><s